            <note corresp="#d17-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d17-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Johnson Library, Clifton Papers, Joint Chiefs of Staff Meetings with the
                    President, Vol. I, Box 2. Top Secret. Another record of this meeting prepared by
                    Taylor is in the National Archives and Records Administration, RG 200, Defense
                    Programs and Operations, Presidential Meetings, Box 142.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d17-f2" n="2" xml:id="d17-f2-content">
