                    President Johnson (CM–1229–64), February 28, containing a list of topics the
                    Joint Chiefs of Staff wanted to discuss with the President. (Johnson Library,
                    Clifton Papers, Joint Chiefs of Staff Meetings with the President, Vol. I, Box
                    2)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d17-f3" n="3" xml:id="d17-f3-content">
                <p>Not found.</p>
            </note>
